        "answer": {
          "short": "$-\\frac{1}{32}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(-2)^{-5}&=\\frac{1}{(-2)^5}\\\\&=\\frac{1}{-32}\\\\&=-\\frac{1}{32}\\end{align*}$$",
